s1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/CurrencyItem-232.png/200px-CurrencyItem-232.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%87%BA%E5%8B%A4%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E\" title=\"出勤证明\">出勤证明</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">配予鬃毛银行合作安保的特别证明，可以在鬃毛避雨所兑换物品。</span></span></span>替代。原「信托票据」所有数被等比例替换为「出勤证明」。</div>\n</div></div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"信托票据\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/61/CurrencyItem-100606.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"信托票据\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>信托票据</b><img alt=\"OldItem-100606.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/CurrencyItem-100606.png/24px-CurrencyItem-100606.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/CurrencyItem-100606.png/36px-CurrencyItem-100606.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/CurrencyItem-100606.png/48px-CurrencyItem-100606.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>26</div></div><hr /><div>珍贵的烫金票据，可在鬃毛信托处兑换物品。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">“传言追捧它的人儿不计其数，尤以棺柩之中的沉默者最为众多。”</div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "包含顶注的页面", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}, {"sortkey": "", "categor